{"_id":"6ac13dd9659e8a86ec378d82","id":"ComplyOnSite/uk-construction-injury-statistics","author":"ComplyOnSite","sha":"2309feb8b0a077bfab5fc08276eb59f7ede3b373","lastModified":"2026-10-03T17:40:47.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["language:en","license:other","size_categories:10K<n<100K","format:csv","modality:document","modality:text","library:datasets","library:pandas","library:polars","library:mlcroissant","region:us","construction","united-kingdom","health-and-safety"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tUK construction injury statistics by ComplyOnSite\n\t\n\nA tidy, long-format copy of the Health and Safety Executive's official workplace injury and ill-health statistics for Great Britain, with a construction focus. It covers worker deaths from 1974, RIDDOR-reported non-fatal injuries, kinds of accident, and the Labour Force Survey estimates of self-reported injury and work-related ill health. Every value is copied from an HSE spreadsheet cell, or counted from HSE's own record-level… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ComplyOnSite/uk-construction-injury-statistics.","downloads":75,"likes":0,"cardData":{"license":"other","license_name":"ogl-v3","license_link":"LICENSE","language":["en"],"pretty_name":"UK construction injury statistics by ComplyOnSite","tags":["construction","united-kingdom","health-and-safety"],"configs":[{"config_name":"construction-only","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"data/construction-only.csv"}],"features":[{"name":"dataset","dtype":"string"},{"name":"year","dtype":"string"},{"name":"year_status","dtype":"string"},{"name":"provisional","dtype":"string"},{"name":"period_type","dtype":"string"},{"name":"industry","dtype":"string"},{"name":"industry_code","dtype":"string"},{"name":"industry_level","dtype":"string"},{"name":"breakdown_type","dtype":"string"},{"name":"breakdown","dtype":"string"},{"name":"worker_group","dtype":"string"},{"name":"measure","dtype":"st